Article 13 (Transitional measures regarding amendments to the Enforcement Decree of the Framework Act on Environmental Policy)
The Central Environmental Policy Committee constituted under Article 19(1) of the previous Enforcement Decree of the Framework Act on Environmental Policy as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed to have been constituted in conformity with the criteria under the amended provisions of the latter part, with the exception of the subparagraphs, of Article 19(1) of that Decree and subparagraph 4 of that paragraph; provided, where members are commissioned after this Decree enters into force (excluding cases of consecutive appointment), persons meeting the criteria under the amended provisions shall be commissioned as members.
